<mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;sync_performance_report_status()&lt;/b&gt; recomputes the status from the entries after each entry decision and stops once the report is approved or rejected. Dashed transitions are outcomes of that recomputation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PIP-bypassed reports cannot be edited or resubmitted; their linked requested instances are waived." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="800" width="520" height="150" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;Inferred – verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether a report rejected with REVIEW_REJECTION can be edited and resubmitted (rejected → submitted) was not traced; REPORT_LIFECYCLE.md only states that PIP-bypassed reports cannot." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="800" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
